# Each Dapptober app reads its own .env.local; the root environment is not loaded.
# Copy apps/agents/day-XX-<name>/.env.example to .env.local in that SAME app folder.
# Each daily template includes known defaults and instructions for keys and addresses.
# Keep .env.local private and out of Git.
# Example for Day 01:
# cp apps/agents/day-01-wallet-genesis/.env.example apps/agents/day-01-wallet-genesis/.env.local
# Repeat for the days you want to configure; do not copy this pointer into an app.
# Setup and remaining deployment work: docs/PROJECT-COMPLETION-TRACKER.md
# Deployment reference: docs/DEPLOYMENT.md
